{"vid":"xWQjrjFglvo","source":"xWQjrjFglvo.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.1,"txt":"[Music]"},{"t":29,"txt":"My name My name is Maher. I work as an"},{"t":31.4,"txt":"outside operator for Saudi Aramco."},{"t":35.1,"txt":"It is very interesting job to do. There"},{"t":38,"txt":"is a lot of training, a lot to learn and"},{"t":40.9,"txt":"a lot of mentorship."},{"t":43,"txt":"All this supports has helped me to learn"},{"t":45.5,"txt":"and to do my task and their procedure"},{"t":47.9,"txt":"safely. When I'm not working, I enjoy"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"going to the gym regularly. I think that"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"keeping fit for the kind of work I do is"},{"t":56.6,"txt":"very important. Being fit also helped me"},{"t":59.6,"txt":"enjoy my life with my friends and family"},{"t":62.1,"txt":"too."},{"t":64,"txt":"My name is Buner and I am an apprentice"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"with Saudi Aramco. I like to play"},{"t":69.4,"txt":"football especially in my uh free time"},{"t":72.2,"txt":"or spare time. Also I like to swim in"},{"t":75.8,"txt":"swimming pool or in sea. I have no"},{"t":78,"txt":"difference. And as we say in Arabic"},{"t":80.8,"txt":"expression the good mind and the good"},{"t":83.8,"txt":"body."},{"t":86.4,"txt":"There are several things I wanted to"},{"t":89,"txt":"know about what a typical day in the"},{"t":91.6,"txt":"life of an outside operator is like."},{"t":95.6,"txt":"So I have some questions. The best way"},{"t":99,"txt":"to get some answers is to talk to the"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"person who does the job for real."},{"t":104.4,"txt":"Generally what's the main job for"},{"t":107,"txt":"outside operator?"},{"t":108.9,"txt":"Oh the outside operators they are uh you"},{"t":112.7,"txt":"know the hearts of the plant. Okay. They"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"follow the job task standard that they"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"are uh to do their task in daily basis."},{"t":128.6,"txt":"What the first task do you do every day?"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"The most important thing that you do is"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"to receive the turnover. You have your"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"time."},{"t":137.7,"txt":"Listen carefully to uh what my"},{"t":140.2,"txt":"supervisor will give me as a"},{"t":141.8,"txt":"instructions. Yes. that to follow."},{"t":152.6,"txt":"In addition, there is some tasks not"},{"t":155,"txt":"being accomplished from the previous"},{"t":156.9,"txt":"shifts. So, as a teamwork, we have to"},{"t":159,"txt":"accomplish what they did and see if"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"there's any other activity to do. Okay."},{"t":163.4,"txt":"So, this the main goal of the the first"},{"t":165.9,"txt":"thing that the operator must do."},{"t":167.6,"txt":"What the other task do you do? The"},{"t":169.8,"txt":"outside operators uh do several tasks."},{"t":173.5,"txt":"Let me give you an example from one of"},{"t":175.3,"txt":"them which is preparing the sample."},{"t":183.8,"txt":"The outside operator prepare the sample"},{"t":185.6,"txt":"for the lab technician to take it. Uh"},{"t":187.8,"txt":"and we have several samples to be taken."},{"t":191.3,"txt":"Sample for the liquid sample for the"},{"t":193.2,"txt":"gases and the sample uh okay for some"},{"t":196.2,"txt":"solids material."},{"t":198.3,"txt":"For each sample we are following"},{"t":201.8,"txt":"certain procedures,"},{"t":204,"txt":"okay, to take these samples. In"},{"t":206,"txt":"addition, the outside operator must"},{"t":208.6,"txt":"inform his supervisor for any finding,"},{"t":211.2,"txt":"any problem that he find."},{"t":214.8,"txt":"Control to outside operator. Over."},{"t":219.4,"txt":"Operator to control. Go ahead. Over."},{"t":221.6,"txt":"Confirm to it reading in a band 470 K001"},{"t":225.9,"txt":"area. Over."},{"t":227,"txt":"Roger that. go over and out."},{"t":230.1,"txt":"Everything in the plant are connect"},{"t":232.1,"txt":"together whether it's valves, pipes, the"},{"t":235.2,"txt":"process in addition to the people itself"},{"t":237.7,"txt":"also the operators they they are all"},{"t":239.8,"txt":"connect together. So uh the operator"},{"t":242.7,"txt":"must he must have technical skills. He"},{"t":246,"txt":"must have uh an excellent way of"},{"t":248.2,"txt":"communication to ensure that the"},{"t":250.2,"txt":"production is safe and smooth."},{"t":253.8,"txt":"It's to reading that K 001 is 0001 ppm"},{"t":259.2,"txt":"over."},{"t":263.8,"txt":"What the other task do you do"},{"t":265.6,"txt":"from the daily task that the operator"},{"t":267.3,"txt":"must do? Monitor the plant equipment"},{"t":275.9,"txt":"by having the reading sheets and to"},{"t":279.1,"txt":"report any failure on the equipment. uh"},{"t":282.3,"txt":"like an example if you found uh the pump"},{"t":284.3,"txt":"that's not functioning well which is one"},{"t":286.6,"txt":"of the most important task of operator"},{"t":289.1,"txt":"you uh you have to report it to to your"},{"t":291,"txt":"shift shift supervisor so he can guide"},{"t":293.5,"txt":"you to the corrective action whether you"},{"t":295.1,"txt":"stop this bomb start a standby one and"},{"t":298.6,"txt":"yeah and take the required thing to"},{"t":301.3,"txt":"contact the maintenance so they can fix"},{"t":303.1,"txt":"this"},{"t":313.5,"txt":"Operator to control. Over."},{"t":318.3,"txt":"Go ahead. Over."},{"t":319.6,"txt":"G 100 has unusual noise. Over."},{"t":323.2,"txt":"Any leaks? Over."},{"t":326.8,"txt":"Negative. Over."},{"t":328.2,"txt":"Switch the bump to stand. Over."},{"t":332,"txt":"Roger. that over and out"},{"t":335.1,"txt":"to be honest when uh when I came to the"},{"t":338,"txt":"plant for the first time I really was"},{"t":340,"txt":"amazed it's a huge equipment how to deal"},{"t":342.8,"txt":"with it and was all always I'm asking"},{"t":345.2,"txt":"myself what I have to do how I can do"},{"t":347.5,"txt":"this one currently I can operate all the"},{"t":351.2,"txt":"equipment in my unit honestly I'm now"},{"t":354.6,"txt":"very excited here in uh my plant and uh"},{"t":358.1,"txt":"my work I'm always be ready for any"},{"t":361.4,"txt":"additional job. I'm always looking"},{"t":363.3,"txt":"forward to improve myself in my field"},{"t":366,"txt":"which is to be honest I'm feel proud"},{"t":367.8,"txt":"about this one because this will affect"},{"t":369.6,"txt":"my country"},{"t":372.1,"txt":"as an apprentice. What else do I need to"},{"t":374.7,"txt":"know?"},{"t":375.7,"txt":"You just seen the four common task for"},{"t":377.5,"txt":"the outside operators. Accept shift"},{"t":379.7,"txt":"turnover, prepare sample, monitor the"},{"t":383,"txt":"equipment, then follow the safety"},{"t":385.9,"txt":"isolation uh procedure for the failure"},{"t":388.1,"txt":"equipment. These are the four uh common"},{"t":391,"txt":"example from the full GTS."},{"t":394,"txt":"The last thing that I do uh the last of"},{"t":396.4,"txt":"my day is to write down and make as a"},{"t":399.1,"txt":"turnover all the things that I do to"},{"t":401.5,"txt":"handle it to the next jet."},{"t":413.4,"txt":"Please ensure that you are well prepared"},{"t":415.4,"txt":"for the plant visit. Ensure that your"},{"t":417.4,"txt":"personal protective equipment are ready."},{"t":420.4,"txt":"Ensure that you have uh the"},{"t":422.1,"txt":"questionnaires with you are ready. And"},{"t":424.3,"txt":"also ensure that your uh equipment list"},{"t":427.5,"txt":"is being prepared with you."},{"t":432.8,"txt":"[Music]"}],"words":[{"t":0.15,"w":"[Music]"},{"t":7.43,"w":"[Music]"},{"t":17.5,"w":"[Music]"},{"t":29.039,"w":"My"},{"t":29.359,"w":"name"},{"t":29.439,"w":"My"},{"t":29.439,"w":"name"},{"t":29.599,"w":"is"},{"t":29.76,"w":"Maher."},{"t":30.56,"w":"I"},{"t":30.8,"w":"work"},{"t":31.039,"w":"as"},{"t":31.279,"w":"an"},{"t":31.439,"w":"outside"},{"t":31.92,"w":"operator"},{"t":32.48,"w":"for"},{"t":32.719,"w":"Saudi"},{"t":33.12,"w":"Aramco."},{"t":35.12,"w":"It"},{"t":35.36,"w":"is"},{"t":35.6,"w":"very"},{"t":36,"w":"interesting"},{"t":36.48,"w":"job"},{"t":36.719,"w":"to"},{"t":36.96,"w":"do."},{"t":37.76,"w":"T